        <tr><td><strong>1–24 hours</strong></td><td>PIM maximum activation duration</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>7 days</strong></td><td>Maximum lifetime of a user delegation SAS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>5,000</strong></td><td>Custom Azure roles per tenant</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>6 levels</strong></td><td>Management group depth below the root group</td></tr>
